  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "A bag of $50$ medium sized apples costs $$25.$ What's the unit price per apple?",
  "worked_solution": "To find the unit price per apple, we divide the total cost by the number of apples:\n\n$$\n25÷50=0.5\n$$\n\nTherefore, the unit price is $$0.50$ per apple.",
